## Escalation Level

L1/L2/L3/exec with rank, target role and `ackTargetMinutes` — an unacknowledged escalation is invisible risk, so the ack clock is first-class. `LEVEL_HUES` is exported beside the enum so every consumer colors the ladder alike.

```ts
import { EscalationLevelField } from '@cardstack/catalog/fields/escalation-level/escalation-level-field';

@field level = contains(EscalationLevelField);
```

### Non-goals

Not the escalation event itself — the consumer's escalation record owns that. Not an on-call rotation.
